  "description": "Mujik is a lowly programmer at a video game company. He regularly gets chewed out by his boss and constantly works overtime. But one day a bug in the virtual reality game he plays makes all the female NPCs fall in love with him. What’s more, the game even rewards him with the ability to charm women…in real life?! Mujik’s office is full of hotties and now he’s gonna make the most of his leveled-up charisma. It’s his game he’s playing now, so let a player play…\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
